  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessing trade-offs and business opportunities for poultry import substitution, and small ruminant value chain development in CARICOM.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public-Private Partnerships are operational to strengthen the small ruminants? value chain, thereby reducing the risk for agribusiness investors (Output 4. 5 and 6). CARICOM adopts and implements the regional poultry sector strategy (Outputs 1, 2  3). CARICOM countries implement Industry business models for the small ruminant sector (Output 4, 5 and 6). A funding proposal is approved in support of  CARICOM countries in the implementation of their national small ruminant upgrading strategies and plans (Output 7)</narrative>
  </description>
